			"notes": "### Added\n\n- Minecraft 1.21.11, 26.1, 26.2 and 26.3. The 26.1 file also covers 26.1.1 and 26.1.2\n- Iron and copper chains get the full chain sound, jingle included when you brush past them\n- On 1.21.11 and later, the Tread Lightly lines on the F3 screen have their own entry in the debug options, so you can switch them off\n- Happy ghasts float rather than walk, so they stay quiet\n\n### Changed\n\n- Each file needs a recent NeoForge: 21.1.235, 21.11.45, 26.1.0.19-beta, 26.2.0.76 or 26.3.0.12-beta and newer, depending on the Minecraft version\n- File names now end with the loader, like `TreadLightly-1.1.0+26.3-neoforge.jar`\n- On 26.3 the settings screen isn't available yet. YetAnotherConfigLib hasn't released a version that loads there, but Tread Lightly runs fine without it\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Climbing a ladder now makes footsteps for your own player"
